(7298190, 1138267, 60173, '<td valign="top">Are they waiting for the ice to melt, so they can safely return to their homes? This image, to me, conveys their dissatisfaction with their predicament very well.</td>', 'Are they waiting for the ice to melt, so they can safely return to their homes? This image, to me, conveys their dissatisfaction with their predicament very well.', '2015-01-03 13:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
