(7300613, 1138323, 18505, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I had one of these back in the day and took it with me on camping trips as my "portable" typewriter (yes, it was b.c. - before computers).  No electricity required.  One could type by lantern light and the ribbons were exceptionally portable and lasted a long, long time.  It produced a very satisfactory product as well.  Thank you for the memories :)</td>', 'Awesome!  I had one of these back in the day and took it with me on camping trips as my "portable" typewriter (yes, it was b.c. - before computers).  No electricity required.  One could type by lantern light and the ribbons were exceptionally portable and lasted a long, long time.  It produced a very satisfactory product as well.  Thank you for the memories :)', '2015-01-09 12:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7300617, 1137901, 18505, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your well-deserved blue ribbon!  What a great start for 2015 all around.</td>', 'Congratulations on your well-deserved blue ribbon!  What a great start for 2015 all around.', '2015-01-09 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
