(7300723, 1138304, 103142, '<td valign="top">It was intentional. I''ve really been trying to play with more of an old masters/rembrandt toning. Sometimes not quite that toning, but the yellows and the greens you find on some older paintings. Sometimes I manage to hit it, sometimes it''s not quite there.<br/></td>', 'It was intentional. I''ve really been trying to play with more of an old masters/rembrandt toning. Sometimes not quite that toning, but the yellows and the greens you find on some older paintings. Sometimes I manage to hit it, sometimes it''s not quite there.', '2015-01-10 07:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
